{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"862901257383837716","content":"https://youtu.be/QTrBcAA4778","created_at":"2021-07-12T18:17:10.280000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864208783797256203","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"862901257383837716","content":"***Transcript:*** (approx 2 minutes)\n\n“Theydies, gentlethems, people and creatures of all ages, we’re back with the truth here on Empire City Post Radio, with your ever gracious host, Finn Midask!\n\nNow everyone, it has been an eventful weekend with reports of Pigeon-Rat-Roach attacks in pedestrian parks and tales of rebellion around the city as the pressure begins to rise.\n\nRedcoats have drastically upped the frequency in which they harass citizens and they expect us to just sit with it? No. They have started cracking down on curfews as an excuse to disarm us, throw us into jail, and forget we exist.\n\nRecently, they began experimenting with targeted profiling. Having sketch wizards create generic archetypes of different races here in Empire City and putting them up everywhere. It’s an effective fear mongering tactic, making you think you have seen a wanted criminal when you head to the ordinary for a pint!\n\nTHESE ARE FRAUDULENT. STAY SAFE EMPIRE CITY. They are Bogus wanted posters designed to give redcoats free reign to detain anyone and “Ask questions later after processing”. If you see them up, RIP THEM DOWN while none of them are looking.\n\nIn other news we do have reports of brave vigilantes targeting and engaging redcoats. Could they be part of Washington’s Minutemen here to keep us safe? The violence erupted after a set of two redcoats were found unconscious and robbed of everything but their clothes in an attempt to re-arm and re-armor our people.\n\nThe 2nd skirmish was much more public early this morning with a small group maneuvering around Hampstead Streets before having a bloody fight with a patrol of redcoats. From the remaining blood, heavy wounds were suffered on both sides, but the bodies left behind were that of Redcoats. Our patriots have triumphed by the hair of lady luck herself.","created_at":"2021-07-12T18:17:39.350000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-12T18:18:01.659000Z","id":"864208905727246347","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"862901257383837716","content":"With news of the greater war coming to us, our beloved public library was destroyed in a bombing after hours. No casualties were recorded but it is unknown whether this was targeted or collateral after Washington’s men redirected it away from civilian homesteads.\n\nNow for the dailies: keep wary of Ferrytown’s fares. Don’t get caught without a way home if you can help it and please do not accept the help of any patrons that live there. Exciting games of skill are currently available to play for reward so test out your power while you can!\n\nKeep up the good fight folks and never back down. This has been your evergracious Finn Midask of the Golden Voice tuning in with the truth.”","created_at":"2021-07-12T18:17:42.587000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864208919303421992","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Orxta","id":"343605682580488215","is_bot":0,"username":"robdor."},"author_id":"343605682580488215","channel_id":"862901257383837716","content":"**Announcement: I'm changing the formatting a bit. This channel has been re-named to <#862901257383837716> . The <#864390188242960434> channel will be for papers only. This should help if folks want to read old editions without getting lost. **","created_at":"2021-07-13T06:25:48.996000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864392153382781020","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"862901257383837716","content":"Finn in Aljarad form makes it to the building and uses his keys to let the group in. He leads them up to a rarely used storage room and places a cone out front of it to make it look like it's under maintenance.\n\n\"I don't know how long you will be able to stay here, but I'll check the sewers when I can and return with news as it reopens.\"\n\nHe waves the small colony goodbye and leaves to his ship","created_at":"2021-07-13T06:30:50.675000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864393418716610560","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
