{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"MinaPoe","id":"443806147649208341","is_bot":0,"username":"minapoe"},"author_id":"443806147649208341","channel_id":"862901257383837716","content":"\"Oh... Did you write this?\" they do a small flourish \"I shall look forward to read more of your accounts of current events. My name is Edward Harkness. But all the pretty ones can just call me Ed\" they say with a smile that somehow doesn't seem all that confident today","created_at":"2021-07-13T18:40:07.431000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864576947852804126","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
