{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"862901257383837716","content":"Finn comes by ready to check the 'radio equipment.' Afterwards he comes back down the stairs and sets all the radios volumes up a bit.\n\n\"Next broadcast coming soon, stay whelmed folks.\"\n\nHe stops and looks at the others.\n\"Oh, new reporters? I've seen you around haven't I?\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T18:44:29.963000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864578048992346121","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"862901257383837716","content":"'I... believe so... briefly.'","created_at":"2021-07-13T18:44:54.969000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864578153875636245","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"862901257383837716","content":"\"Not a wordy guy myself, I don't think. Just seeing what I can see around, I suppose.\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T18:45:31.007000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864578305030488124","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"MinaPoe","id":"443806147649208341","is_bot":0,"username":"minapoe"},"author_id":"443806147649208341","channel_id":"862901257383837716","content":"\"I am... more of a reader... than a writer, I'm afraid. \"","created_at":"2021-07-13T18:47:30.771000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864578807356325898","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"862901257383837716","content":"He talks fast with excitement attempting to catch you up to speed. \n\n\"Well welcome into the fold. Names Finn Midask, you've heard me on the radios around here. Word and news change and travel fast, but we have to be faster. Luckily, we aren't alone. I have 3 of my employees always out collecting the word around here when I get my stories.\n\nDont fret if this gigs not for you, you're always welcome as part of our audience. We strive to get the truth out to you.\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T18:48:10.354000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864578973379067954","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"862901257383837716","content":"Sabrine nods. 'Sabrine... Lovlatar.' with her tongue in the way it's difficult to actually speak her name, so she switches to telepathy, ||Pleased to meet you, or re-meet you as the case may be.||","created_at":"2021-07-13T18:48:56.501000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864579166934269971","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"862901257383837716","content":"\"Noble cause, worth praising. Roy. Roy Gat. Just a mechanic.\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T18:49:30.305000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864579308718129212","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"862901257383837716","content":"\"My next story is covering the sewers, rat roach attacks, and funny business around the clocktower. As well as the weather with the Noir and hampstead. It's a moderate segment but can always use more details in the columns.\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T18:49:32.840000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864579319351214090","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"MinaPoe","id":"443806147649208341","is_bot":0,"username":"minapoe"},"author_id":"443806147649208341","channel_id":"862901257383837716","content":"\"Greetings, Mr Midask... I was together with you in last night's venture into the sewers if you remember. I was split from half the party and haven't seen some people around\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T18:49:41.355000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864579355065974805","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"862901257383837716","content":"\"Oh, that's right, we talked with some people earlier who were there too. Were ones I met in Murry Hill from that expedition?\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T18:50:18.485000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864579510800220181","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"862901257383837716","content":"\"Oh we've met before? I apologize, you do look familiar just couldn't place the names, maybe we never formerly introduced ourselves. I'm glad you made it out, it's unfortunate many others did not\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T18:50:24.526000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864579536137093120","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"MinaPoe","id":"443806147649208341","is_bot":0,"username":"minapoe"},"author_id":"443806147649208341","channel_id":"862901257383837716","content":"\"Let me formally introduce myself. The name is Ed, Ed Harkness\" they do an overexagerated flourish and almost fall foward","created_at":"2021-07-13T18:52:15.189000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864580000291880980","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"862901257383837716","content":"\"Wait. Was Apgan with you?\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T18:52:20.879000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864580024157470752","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"862901257383837716","content":"she looks confused. 'Wait... what happened... to Apgan? We... saw his ghost... but he didn't... come back...'","created_at":"2021-07-13T18:53:05.710000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864580212191920158","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"862901257383837716","content":"'Did... something go... wrong?'","created_at":"2021-07-13T18:53:15.655000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864580253905322005","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"MinaPoe","id":"443806147649208341","is_bot":0,"username":"minapoe"},"author_id":"443806147649208341","channel_id":"862901257383837716","content":"\"Wait... Apgan... the tatankan? Big strong handsome guy Apgan?!\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T18:53:54.360000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864580416245858344","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"862901257383837716","content":"\"Apgan, I remember him. The Tatankan that wanted to avoid politics despite being targeted. If he didn't come back he needs help. Any of you willing to join me?\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T18:53:56.993000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864580427288018974","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
